{"step_index":51,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:24:25Z","thinking":"Developing a universal arcade engine player requires a dynamic approach. This engine will load game-specific themes, categories, and generate interactive challenges tailored to each title. It dynamically configures these elements to provide a custom arcade experience for any of the available games.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>Game Runner</title>\n  <script src=\"https://telegram.org/js/telegram-web-app.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; user-select: none; }\n    body {\n      background: #090d16;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      touch-action: none;\n    }\n    .header {\n      width: 90vw;\n      max-width: 380px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .game-name {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #38bdf8;\n      max-width: 200px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n    }\n    .score-badge {\n      background: #1e293b;\n      border: 1px solid #334155;\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #10b981;\n    }\n    #game-canvas {\n      background: #0d131f;\n      border: 2px solid #1e293b;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n      width: 90vw;\n      max-width: 380px;\n      height: 72vh;\n      max-height: 520px;\n      display: block;\n    }\n    .controls {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-top: 12px;\n      width: 90vw;\n      max-width: 380px;\n    }\n    .c-btn {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 12px;\n      background: #1e293b;\n      color: #38bdf8;\n      border: 1px solid #38bdf8;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .c-btn:active { background: #38bdf8; color: #000; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"game-name\" id=\"game-title\">Arcade Game</div>\n    <div class=\"score-badge\">SCORE: <span id=\"score\">0</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <canvas id=\"game-canvas\"></canvas>\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <button class=\"c-btn\" id=\"btn-left\">◀</button>\n    <button class=\"c-btn\" id=\"btn-jump\">JUMP ⚡</button>\n    <button class=\"c-btn\" id=\"btn-right\">▶</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const tg = window.Telegram?.WebApp;\n    if (tg) tg.expand();\n\n    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n    const gameId = params.get('id') || 'game-unknown';\n    const gameTitle = params.get('title') || 'Arcade Adventure';\n    const category = params.get('cat') || 'Arcade';\n\n    document.getElementById('game-title').innerText = gameTitle;\n\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('game-canvas');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    canvas.width = 380;\n    canvas.height = 520;\n\n    // Theme color based on category\n    const catColors = {\n      'Arcade': '#06b6d4',\n      'Puzzle': '#8b5cf6',\n      'Action': '#ef4444',\n      'Racing': '#f97316',\n      'Sports': '#10b981',\n      'Retro': '#ec4899',\n      'Cards & Board': '#3b82f6',\n      'Casual': '#eab308'\n    };\n    const mainColor = catColors[category] || '#38bdf8';\n\n    let player = { x: 170, y: 400, vx: 0, vy: 0, w: 26, h: 26, jumping: false };\n    let obstacles = [];\n    let gems = [];\n    let particles = [];\n    let score = 0;\n    let speed = 4;\n    let frame = 0;\n    let gameOver = false;\n\n    function resetGame() {\n      player.x = 170;\n      player.y = 400;\n      player.vx = 0;\n      player.vy = 0;\n      player.jumping = false;\n      obstacles = [];\n      gems = [];\n      score = 0;\n      speed = 4;\n      frame = 0;\n      gameOver = false;\n      document.getElementById('score').innerText = '0';\n    }\n\n    // Touch and Keyboard inputs\n    let moveLeft = false, moveRight = false;\n    document.getElementById('btn-left').onpointerdown = () => moveLeft = true;\n    document.getElementById('btn-left').onpointerup = () => moveLeft = false;\n    document.getElementById('btn-right').onpointerdown = () => moveRight = true;\n    document.getElementById('btn-right').onpointerup = () => moveRight = false;\n    document.getElementById('btn-jump').onpointerdown = doJump;\n\n    window.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n      if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') moveLeft = true;\n      if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') moveRight = true;\n      if (e.key === 'ArrowUp' || e.code === 'Space') doJump();\n    });\n    window.addEventListener('keyup', e => {\n      if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') moveLeft = false;\n      if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') moveRight = false;\n    });\n\n    function doJump() {\n      if (!player.jumping && !gameOver) {\n        player.vy = -12;\n        player.jumping = true;\n        if (tg?.HapticFeedback) tg.HapticFeedback.impactOccurred('light');\n      } else if (gameOver) {\n        resetGame();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function update() {\n      if (gameOver) return;\n      frame++;\n\n      if (moveLeft) player.x = Math.max(10, player.x - 6);\n      if (moveRight) player.x = Math.min(canvas.width - player.w - 10, player.x + 6);\n\n      // Gravity\n      player.vy += 0.65;\n      player.y += player.vy;\n      if (player.y >= 400) {\n        player.y = 400;\n        player.vy = 0;\n        player.jumping = false;\n      }\n\n      // Spawning obstacles\n      if (frame % 50 === 0) {\n        obstacles.push({\n          x: Math.random() * (canvas.width - 50) + 10,\n          y: -30,\n          w: Math.random() * 20 + 20,\n          h: 20\n        });\n      }\n\n      // Spawning gems\n      if (frame % 35 === 0) {\n        gems.push({\n          x: Math.random() * (canvas.width - 30) + 10,\n          y: -20,\n          r: 8\n        });\n      }\n\n      // Move obstacles\n      for (let i = obstacles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n        const obs = obstacles[i];\n        obs.y += speed;\n\n        // Collision check\n        if (\n          player.x < obs.x + obs.w &&\n          player.x + player.w > obs.x &&\n          player.y < obs.y + obs.h &&\n          player.y + player.h > obs.y\n        ) {\n          triggerGameOver();\n          return;\n        }\n\n        if (obs.y > canvas.height + 20) {\n          obstacles.splice(i, 1);\n          score += 5;\n          document.getElementById('score').innerText = score;\n        }\n      }\n\n      // Move gems\n      for (let i = gems.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n        const g = gems[i];\n        g.y += speed;\n\n        if (Math.hypot((player.x + player.w / 2) - g.x, (player.y + player.h / 2) - g.y) < player.w / 2 + g.r) {\n          gems.splice(i, 1);\n          score += 25;\n          document.getElementById('score').innerText = score;\n          if (tg?.HapticFeedback) tg.HapticFeedback.impactOccurred('medium');\n          continue;\n        }\n\n        if (g.y > canvas.height + 20) gems.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n\n      // Increase speed gradually\n      if (frame % 300 === 0) speed = Math.min(10, speed + 0.5);\n    }\n\n    function triggerGameOver() {\n      gameOver = true;\n      if (tg?.HapticFeedback) tg.HapticFeedback.notificationOccurred('error');\n      window.parent.postMessage({\n        type: 'SCORE_UPDATE',\n        gameId: gameId,\n        score: score\n      }, '*');\n    }\n\n    function draw() {\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#0b101b';\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n      // Cyber Grid Lines\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#162032';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n      for (let x = 0; x < canvas.width; x += 40) {\n        ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x, 0); ctx.lineTo(x, canvas.height); ctx.stroke();\n      }\n\n      // Ground Line\n      ctx.strokeStyle = mainColor;\n      ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.moveTo(0, 426);\n      ctx.lineTo(canvas.width, 426);\n      ctx.stroke();\n\n      // Gems\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#38bdf8';\n      ctx.shadowColor = '#38bdf8';\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 10;\n      gems.forEach(g => {\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(g.x, g.y, g.r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fill();\n      });\n\n      // Obstacles\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#f43f5e';\n      ctx.shadowColor = '#f43f5e';\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 8;\n      obstacles.forEach(o => {\n        ctx.fillRect(o.x, o.y, o.w, o.h);\n      });\n\n      // Player\n      ctx.fillStyle = mainColor;\n      ctx.shadowColor = mainColor;\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 15;\n      ctx.fillRect(player.x, player.y, player.w, player.h);\n      ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n\n      // Game Over Screen\n      if (gameOver) {\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.7)';\n        ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ef4444';\n        ctx.font = 'bold 26px sans-serif';\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.fillText('GAME OVER', canvas.width / 2, 210);\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n        ctx.font = '18px sans-serif';\n        ctx.fillText('Score: ' + score, canvas.width / 2, 250);\n        ctx.fillStyle = mainColor;\n        ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n        ctx.fillText('Tap JUMP to Retry', canvas.width / 2, 300);\n      }\n    }\n\n    function loop() {\n      update();\n      draw();\n      requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n    }\n    loop();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Universal Web Runner for catalog games","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/games/web_runner/index.html","toolAction":"Creating Web Runner game","toolSummary":"Create Universal Web Runner HTML5 engine"}}]}
