{"step_index":53,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:24:48Z","thinking":"Focus is now on the frontend web app for the Telegram Mini App. Planning the structure involves creating an `index.html` file for the Gamee-style UI. A `style.css` file will be used to implement the dark cyber arcade theme, responsive design, and visual elements. The app logic will reside in `app.js`, handling Telegram WebApp integration, real-time game search, category filtering, and pagination.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":":root {\n  --bg-primary: #0a0e17;\n  --bg-secondary: #131a29;\n  --bg-card: #182236;\n  --bg-hover: #22304c;\n  --accent-cyan: #00f2fe;\n  --accent-blue: #4facfe;\n  --accent-purple: #9d4edd;\n  --accent-pink: #f72585;\n  --accent-green: #10b981;\n  --text-main: #f8fafc;\n  --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n  --border-color: #27354f;\n  --glow-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background-color: var(--bg-primary);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding-bottom: 70px;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n/* App Header */\n.app-header {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 100;\n  background: rgba(10, 14, 23, 0.92);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.brand-icon {\n  font-size: 26px;\n  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px #00f2fe);\n}\n\n.brand-title {\n  font-size: 19px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-blue));\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n\n.user-profile-badge {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.user-score {\n  color: #fbbf24;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n/* Hero Carousel / Featured */\n.featured-section {\n  padding: 14px 16px;\n}\n\n.featured-banner {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #311042 100%);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.4);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 18px;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.2);\n}\n\n.featured-banner::after {\n  content: \"🎮\";\n  position: absolute;\n  right: -10px;\n  bottom: -15px;\n  font-size: 85px;\n  opacity: 0.15;\n}\n\n.featured-tag {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.featured-title {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.featured-desc {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  max-width: 75%;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.featured-btn {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-blue));\n  color: #030712;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 8px 18px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n/* Search Bar */\n.search-container {\n  padding: 0 16px 10px 16px;\n}\n\n.search-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.search-input {\n  background: transparent;\n  border: none;\n  outline: none;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.search-input::placeholder {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* Category Filter Tabs */\n.categories-tabs {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  padding: 6px 16px 12px 16px;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n}\n.categories-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n\n.cat-tab {\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.cat-tab.active {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-blue));\n  color: #040814;\n  border-color: transparent;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n/* Stats Counter */\n.section-header {\n  padding: 0 16px 8px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.section-title {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.catalog-counter {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n  background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n/* Game Cards Grid */\n.games-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding: 0 16px 20px 16px;\n}\n\n.game-card {\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  transition: transform 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.game-card:active {\n  transform: scale(0.97);\n}\n\n.game-thumb-box {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b, #0f172a);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 42px;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.game-badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 6px;\n  left: 6px;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n  color: #38bdf8;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);\n}\n\n.fav-btn {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 6px;\n  right: 6px;\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);\n  border: none;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  width: 26px;\n  height: 26px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.fav-btn.active {\n  color: #f43f5e;\n}\n\n.game-info {\n  padding: 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  flex-grow: 1;\n}\n\n.game-title {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.game-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.game-rating {\n  color: #fbbf24;\n}\n\n.play-action-btn {\n  margin-top: auto;\n  background: var(--bg-hover);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  color: #38bdf8;\n  padding: 6px 0;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-align: center;\n  transition: background 0.15s;\n}\n\n.play-action-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-blue);\n  color: #000;\n}\n\n/* Bottom Navigation Bar */\n.bottom-nav {\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 60px;\n  background: rgba(10, 14, 23, 0.96);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-around;\n  align-items: center;\n  z-index: 99;\n}\n\n.nav-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.nav-item.active {\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.nav-icon {\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n\n/* Modal Player */\n.game-modal {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  background: #000;\n  z-index: 200;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.game-modal.open {\n  display: flex;\n}\n\n.modal-bar {\n  height: 48px;\n  background: #0a0e17;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 0 14px;\n}\n\n.modal-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #fff;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  max-width: 60%;\n}\n\n.modal-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.modal-btn {\n  background: #1e293b;\n  border: 1px solid #334155;\n  color: #fff;\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.modal-btn.close {\n  background: #dc2626;\n  border-color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n.modal-frame {\n  flex-grow: 1;\n  width: 100%;\n  border: none;\n  background: #090d16;\n}\n\n/* Leaderboard Modal / View */\n.view-modal {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 60px;\n  background: var(--bg-primary);\n  z-index: 110;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  padding: 20px 16px;\n}\n\n.view-modal.open {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.leader-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  background: var(--bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.leader-rank {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  width: 32px;\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n}\n\n.leader-name {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  flex-grow: 1;\n}\n\n.leader-score {\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #fbbf24;\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n\n/* Empty State / Loading */\n.empty-state {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 40px 20px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n","Description":"Create CSS styles for Telegram Mini App frontend","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/root/telegram_game_bot/webapp/static/css/style.css","toolAction":"Creating CSS styles","toolSummary":"Create WebApp style.css"}}]}
